    },
    {
      "text": "No directed cycles were found through 311052, so a closed round-trip (funds returning to origin) is not evidenced; the observed structure is a linear chain, not a cycle.",
      "citations": ["find_cycles:call_00_Brh5d24IXsWFb0IbhS2162", "context.cycles"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The repeated amounts could reflect scheduled or recurring payments (e.g. payroll, subscription or invoice batches) rather than layering; the package contains no counterparty names, purpose codes or memo fields to distinguish these.",
      "citations": ["provenance.known_gaps", "transaction.payment_format"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The corpus passages retrieved on structuring concern currency transactions and CTR thresholds; the alert transaction is ACH (fmt_ach = 1, fmt_cash = 0), so the structuring passages do not directly apply and no cash structuring typology is supported here.",
